#. type: Plain text
#: docs/self-layer.md:67
msgid "## Autobiography Summary vs Autobiographical Narrative"
msgstr "## 自传概括 vs 自传叙事"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/self-layer.md:75
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Dimension | `autobiography_summary` (self layer) | `autobiographical_memory` (memory layer) |\n"
"| --------- | ------------------------------------ | ---------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Question | \"What is the main thread of my life story?\" | \"What did a given experience mean to me?\" |\n"
"| Form | One of six blocks, Markdown summary | Separate table, title + content narrative entries |\n"
"| Injection | **Always resident** in system prompt | **Not** resident; recall / list on demand |\n"
"| Maintenance | `builtin-self-autobiography` cron compresses from narrative table into summary block | Same cron processes narrative from `semantic_memory` (experience/imprint) |\n"
"| Mutability | Periodically overwrites summary block | **Append-only**; soft deprecation via `deprecate` only |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 维度   | `autobiography_summary`（自我层）                  | `autobiographical_memory`（记忆层）                          |\n"
"| ------ | -------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n"
"| 问题   | 「我的生平主线概括是什么？」                       | 「某段经历对我意味着什么？」                                 |\n"
"| 形态   | 六块之一，Markdown 摘要                            | 独立表，title + content 叙事条目                             |\n"
"| 注入   | **常驻** system prompt                             | **不**常驻；按需 recall / 列表                               |\n"
"| 维护   | `builtin-self-autobiography` cron 从叙事表压缩写入 | 同一 cron 从 `semantic_memory`（experience/imprint）叙事加工 |\n"
"| 可变性 | 周期性覆盖 summary 块                              | **只追加**；仅 `deprecate` 软废弃                            |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/self-layer.md:77
msgid "See [`sleep.md`](sleep.md) §Autobiography cron."
msgstr "详见 [`sleep.md`](sleep.md) §自传 cron。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/self-layer.md:81
msgid "## System Prompt Injection"
msgstr "## System Prompt 注入"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/self-layer.md:83
msgid ""
"Assembly order ([`life-memory/system-prompt`](../life/memory/src/system-"
"prompt.ts) + [`system-prompt-wire`](../service/service/src/runtime/system-"
"prompt-wire.ts)):"
msgstr ""
"组装顺序（[`life-memory/system-prompt`](../life/memory/src/system-prompt.ts) "
"+ [`system-prompt-wire`](../service/service/src/runtime/system-prompt-"
"wire.ts)）："

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/self-layer.md:89
msgid ""
"```` 1. Self layer (second-person skeleton + six blocks embedded in ```md)  "
"← loadSelfLayerPrompt() / self_blocks 2. Resident memory (second-person "
"skeleton + ```md embedded pinned facts)  ← semantic_memory 3. Project "
"context (```md embedded session cwd AGENTS.md)  ````"
msgstr ""
"```` 1. 自我层（第二人称骨架 + ```md 内嵌六块） ← loadSelfLayerPrompt() / "
"self_blocks 2. 常驻记忆（第二人称骨架 + ```md 内嵌 pinned 事实） ← "
"semantic_memory 3. 项目上下文（```md 内嵌 session cwd 下 AGENTS.md） ````"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/self-layer.md:91
msgid ""
"Section headings (`## 自我层` / `## 常驻记忆` / `## 项目上下文`) sit outside "
"code blocks; body text inside `md` fences. Self layer and resident memory "
"segments use a second-person instruction skeleton on the outside, first-"
"person self-statement texture on the inside."
msgstr ""
"各段标题（`## 自我层` / `## 常驻记忆` / `## 项目上下文`）在代码块外；正文在 "
"`md` 围栏内。自我层与常驻记忆段外层使用第二人称指令骨架，内层保留第一人称自我"
"陈述质地。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/self-layer.md:93
msgid ""
"Maintenance: `get_self_blocks` / `update_self_block` tools, or direct writes "
"to PG `self_blocks`."
msgstr ""
"维护方式：`get_self_blocks` / `update_self_block` 工具，或直接写 PG "
"`self_blocks`。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/self-layer.md:97
msgid "## Relationship to Memory Layer"
msgstr "## 与记忆层的关系"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/self-layer.md:104
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Dimension | Memory layer | Self layer |\n"
"| --------- | ------------ | ---------- |\n"
"| Direction | Outward—records world and experiences | Inward—defines self |\n"
"| Question | \"What do I know?\" | \"Who am I?\" |\n"
"| Autobiography | Detailed narrative in `autobiographical_memory` | Summary in `autobiography_summary` |\n"
"| Injection | Pinned facts + recall on demand | All six blocks always resident |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 维度 | 记忆层                               | 自我层                         |\n"
"| ---- | ------------------------------------ | ------------------------------ |\n"
"| 方向 | 向外——记录世界和经历                 | 向内——定义自我                 |\n"
"| 问题 | 「我知道什么？」                     | 「我是谁？」                   |\n"
"| 自传 | 详细叙事在 `autobiographical_memory` | 概括在 `autobiography_summary` |\n"
"| 注入 | pinned 事实 + recall 按需            | 六块全部常驻                   |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/self-layer.md:113
msgid ""
"``` v1 (2026-05-30)  Four-block conceptual model + narrative file runtime "
"injection (deprecated)  v2 (2026-06-07)  PG self_blocks six blocks + "
"autobiographical_memory separate table + 04:00 autobiography cron ```"
msgstr ""
"``` v1（2026-05-30） 四块概念模型 + 叙事文件运行时注入（已废弃） v2"
"（2026-06-07） PG self_blocks 六块 + autobiographical_memory 独立表 + 04:00 "
"自传 cron ```"

